 savings plan that provides double life insurance coverage throughout your lifetime. It also gives additional cash benefits that you can use to help fund your child’s education needs.\n\n✅RETIREMENT - SUN Smarter Life Elite is a protection and savings plan that provides double life insurance coverage throughout your lifetime. It also gives additional cash benefits, which can serve as regular income during your golden years.\n\n✅PREPARING FOR LIFE MILESTONE - \nSUN Smarter Life Elite is a protection and savings plan that provides double life insurance coverage throughout your lifetime. It also gives additional cash benefits that you can use to grow your savings and fund future goals or target milestones.\n\nBenefits:\n\nLife insurance coverage\nSecure your loved ones’ future with life insurance benefit worth twice the Face Amount of your plan, providing coverage until age 100 or maturity.\n\nEnhance your plan with the addition of riders or supplemental benefits which can provide added protection for contingencies such as accidents, disability and illnesses.\n\nLifetime guaranteed cash benefits\nEnjoy regular guaranteed cash benefits throughout your lifetime, starting at the end of the sixth year of your plan and every two years afterwards. You may also choose to leave your cash benefits with Sun Life to accumulate and be available for future needs.\n\nLiving benefits\nEarn dividends from your plan which you may use to increase your insurance coverage, pay for future premiums, leave with Sun Life to accumulate, or receive in cash. In case of emergencies, money also comes in handy via a policy loan against your plan’s cash value instead of borrowing from various financial institutions or selling your prized possessions.\n\nA portion of your Face Amount may also be given in advance if the life insured is diagnosed to be terminally ill.\n\nManageable premium payments\nPay your premiums regularly on an annual, semi-annual, or quarterly basis. You may also opt for a shorter guaranteed payment period of only 5 or 10 years.\n\nMonthly payment through Auto-Debit or Auto-Charge may also be arranged after payment of the initial quarterly premium.\n\nNOTE: Benefits indicated above are subject to the specific guidelines set by Sun Life and the actual provisions of the insurance policy contract.\n\nFor more inquires:\nhttps://www.facebook.com/JonahChavezSunLifeFinancialAdvisor?mibextid=LQQJ4d", "channel_id": "UCrUPrJpx2D5Kpi8AsAJ_UpA", "channel_url": "https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCrUPrJpx2D5Kpi8AsAJ_UpA", "duration": 1119, "view_count": 6495, "age_limit": 0, "webpage_url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=wL-imsdfvIY", "categories": ["Travel & Events"], "tags": [], "playable_in_embed": true, "live_status": "not_live", "media_type": "video", "_format_sort_fields": ["quality", "res", "fps", "hdr:12", "source", "vcodec", "channels", "acodec", "lang", "proto"], "automatic_captions": {}, "subtitles": {}, "comment_count": 11, "chapters": [{"start_time": 0, "end_time": 29.0, "title": "<Untitled Chapter 1>"}, {"start_time": 29.0, "title": "Types of Pamana 1.Asset (Income)", "end_time": 350.0}, {"start_time": 350.0, "title": "Accummulated Dividends, Endowment - around 3.6% -3.9%", "end_time": 773.0}, {"start_time": 773.0, "title": "GENERATIONAL WEALTH (Pamana Income for Life)", "end_time": 792.0}, {"start_time": 792.0, "title": "FLEXIBLE PAYMENT OPTION", "end_time": 1039.0}, {"start_time": 1039.0, "title": "SAMPLE FIGURES: ANNUAL PAYMENT Sample: Female, 30yo, Non Smoker - Policy Owner", "end_time": 1119}], "like_count": 59, "channel": "Jonah Chavez", "channel_follower_count": 522, "uploader": "Jonah Chavez", "uploader_id": "@JonahChavezRanchez", "uploader_url": "https://www.youtube.com/@JonahChavezRanchez", "upload_date": "20230125", "timestamp": 1674663989, "availability": "public", "webpage_url_basename": "watch", "webpage_url_domain": "youtube.com", "extractor": "youtube", "extractor_key": "Youtube", "playlist_count": 564, "playlist": "sun lif